              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Summarize the following comments:\n```\n{{$context.$nodes.CLEANUP_COMMENTS_REST_RESULT.$output.result}}\n```\nOutput using HTML formatting suitable to place inside a <div>. Do not include <head> or <body> tags.\nOutput the results in HTML unordered list using <ul> and <li> bullet-point form, for example: <b>Pipe size:</b> the pipe size is incorrect\nDo not include include extraneous words like \"this is a summary\".\nDo not include carriage returns or newlines since those are extraneous in HTML formatting."
